<title>CHINA: Cheong Kong invests $108 m in China road.</title>
<headline>Cheong Kong invests $108 m in China road.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Cheung Kong Group will invest 895 million yuan ($108 million) to build a ring road around China's northeastern city of Shenyang, Chinese officials said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Cheung Kong Group, whose flagship company is Cheung Kong Holdings Ltd and includes Cheung Kong Infrastructure Holdings Ltd, would hold a 52 percent stake in the ring road said an official from the project's Chinese partner.</p>
</text>
